+| Version | 1.11.0-1+deb11u2 |
+| Distribution | Debian 11 (Bullseye) |
+| Upstream Version | 1.11.0 |
+| Status | **NOT AFFECTED** |
+| Justification | `vulnerable_code_not_present` |
+
+The Debian tracker still lists bullseye as vulnerable. This marker documents the code-level verdict only.
+
